# devflow
# Machine-local overlay for devflow.toml (admin URL, declared CoW, ...). Never commit.
devflow.local.toml
# 0.x machine-local config (may hold provider API keys); kept ignored until migrated.
.devflow.local.yml
# Generated env and secrets. devflow writes a `.gitignore` containing `*` inside
# `.devflow/`, so the directory ignores itself; this entry is a second guard for
# this repository's own worktrees.
.devflow/

